| **Model Type**                | **Training Cost** | **Inference Cost** | **Hardware Needs**                     | **Efficiency (Speed)**       | **Notes**                           |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------ | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| **GANs**                      | 🔴 **High**       | 🟡 **Moderate**    | 🟥 **High-end GPU** (e.g., A100, V100) | 🟡 Moderate                  | Unstable training, many trials      |
| **VAEs**                      | 🟡 **Moderate**   | 🟢 **Low**         | 🟡 **Mid-tier GPU** (e.g., T4, 3060)   | 🟢 Fast                      | Efficient, but lower output quality |
| **Autoregressive (e.g. GPT)** | 🔴 **Very High**  | 🔴 **High**        | 🟥 **Very High-end GPU or TPU**        | 🔴 Slow (token-by-token)     | Cost scales with output length      |
| **Diffusion Models**          | 🔴 **High**       | 🟡 **Moderate**    | 🟥 **High-end GPU** (large VRAM)       | 🔴 Slow (many denoise steps) | Stable, but compute-intensive       |
| **Flow-based Models**         | 🔴 **High**       | 🟢 **Low**         | 🟡 **Mid-tier GPU**                    | 🟡 Moderate                  | Exact likelihood, parallelizable    |
